> e'i    to'e zifre

Here I would use "minde".

> e'o    cpedu
> e'u    stidi
> ei    bilga

"bilga" only works when the speaker is also the agent. But "ei" is
more general, "x1 feels that x2 ought to be the case", where x2 is not
necesarily something that the speaker has to do.

